      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EAshen-keys.\u003C/b\u003E Gather them young, and boil them in three or four Waters to extract the Bitterness; and when they feel tender, prepare a syrup [131] of sharp White-Wine Vinegar, sugar, and a little Water. Then boil them on a very quick Fire, and they will become of a green Colour, fit to be potted so soon as cold.\u003Cbr\u003E"
